{{bg-proper noun|Евро́па|f|adj=европе́йски}}

# {{place|bg|continent|t=Europe}}
# {{lb|bg|Greek mythology}} [[Europa]] {{gloss|princess abducted to Crete by Zeus in Greek mythology}}
# {{lb|bg|astronomy}} [[Europa]] {{gloss|moon of [[Jupiter]]}}

====Usage notes====
* Normally, it is not used with the definite article as it is a proper noun. For example:
** {{ux|bg|'''Евро́па''' е бога́та|'''Europe''' is rich.}}
* However, when referring to a Bulgarian in a derogatory way, who is heading for Europe, the definite article is used and it becomes feminine:
** {{ux|bg|Ба́й Га́ньо тръ́гнал по Евро́па'''та'''.|{{w|Bay Ganyo}} has headed for '''that''' Europe!}}

