====Usage notes====
* The letter {{m|lo|ຣ}} is officially obsolete yet remains in widespread use. Words spelled with ຣ all have an equivalent spelled with ລ which is nominally more official or standard. Which is more popular for a given Lao word is partly arbitrary.

* Other spellings exist in dictionaries and are due to borrowing from English, yet they are seldom used: {{l|lo|ຍຸໂຣບ}}, {{l|lo|ຍູໂລບ}}, {{l|lo|ຢຸຣົບ}}. {{l|lo|ຢຸໂຣບ}}.

