Page 480 Africa: -------- begin text --------
{{also|africa|áfrica|africà|África|Àfrica}}
==English==
{{wikipedia}}
{{wikipedia|Afri}}

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|Afrika}} {{qualifier|sometimes used in AAVE}}
* {{l|en|Affrike}} {{qualifier|archaic}}
* {{l|en|Afric}} {{qualifier|poetic, archaic}}
* {{l|en|Africk}} {{q|obsolete}}
* {{l|en|Afficky}} {{q|obsolete}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|Affrike}}, from {{der|en|fro|Affrique}}, {{m|fro|Affrike}}, from {{der|en|la|Āfrica}}, from {{m|la|Āfrī}}, singular {{m|la|Āfer}} (inhabitant of the [[w:Ancient Carthage|country of Carthage]]), in turn either from:
* The {{der|en|xpu|-}} or {{der|en|phn|-}} word {{m|phn|𐤏𐤐𐤓|ts=ʿafar|t=dust}}, which has cognates in other Semitic languages.
* The {{der|en|ber|-}} word {{m|und|ifri|t=cave}}, plural {{m|und|ifran}}, in reference to cave dwellers of Tunisia (see [[w:Tataouine|Tataouine]]).

Folk etymologies include:
* {{der|en|grc|ἀ-}} + {{m|grc|φρίκη|g=f}}, meaning "without cold"
* {{cog|la|aprica|t=sunny}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈæf.ɹɪ.kə/|a=RP,US,CA}}
* {{IPA|en|/ɛfrɨkə/|a=South Africa}}
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860_(eng)-Justinrleung-Africa.wav|a=Canada}}
* {{rhymes|en|æfɹɪkə|s=3}}

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun|~}}

# {{senseid|en|Q15}}The [[continent]] that is south of [[Europe]], east of the [[Atlantic Ocean]], west of the [[Indian Ocean]] and north of [[Antarctica]].
#: ''the Maghreb and sub-Saharan '''Africa'''''
#: {{syn|en|q1=sometimes offensive, dated, informal|Dark Continent}}
# {{lb|en|nonstandard|proscribed}} {{cap|sub-Saharan Africa}}, contrasted with the [[Maghreb]].
#* {{quote-book|en|date=2021-06-10|author=Abdelmajid Hannoum|title=The Invention of the Maghreb: Between Africa and the Middle East|publisher=Cambridge University Press|isbn=9781108838160|page=205
|text=The Sahara stood as an important marker between the '''Maghreb''' and Africa, not only in modern times but in times immemorial.}}
# {{lb|en|historical}} {{place|en|province|empire/Roman Empire}} containing what is now modern [[Tunisia]] and portions of [[Libya]].
# {{surname|en}}.

