{{zh-pron
|m=Àozhōu
|c=ou3 zau1
|c-t=au1 ziu1
|h=pfs=O-chû
|md=Ó̤-ciŭ
|mn=Ò-chiu
|mn-t=o3 ziu1
|w=sh:5au tseu
|cat=pn
}}

===Proper noun===
{{head|zh|proper noun}}

# {{tcl|zh|Australia|id=Q408}}
#: {{zh-x|低價 讓 ^中國 商品 在 ^澳洲 的 市場 打開 局面。|The low price of China's goods allows them to break into the '''Australian''' market.}}
#* {{quote-book|zh|year=1904|title=w:zh:新大陸遊記<t:Travel Notes of the New Continent>|author={{w|Liang Qichao}}|year_published=1907|publisher=廣智書局|page=8|pageurl=https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=File:NLC416-13jh001673-59307_%E6%96%B0%E5%A4%A7%E9%99%B8%E9%81%8A%E8%A8%98.pdf&page=30}}
#*: {{zh-x|澳洲 之 ^西澳、^南澳 兩 省{shěng}，限 能 解 英語 五十 句 以上 者，乃 可 登陸。|In Western '''Australia''' and South '''Australia''', entry is limited to those who can understand more than fifty sentences in English.||CL}}
#* {{zh-x|^澳洲 週日（@26 日）通報 有 @10 人 死 於 2019冠{guān}狀病毒病，創 疫情 爆發 創 單日 死亡 數字 新高。|'''Australia''' reported on Sunday (26th) that 10 people died from COVID-19, marking a new single-day high since the outbreak of the pandemic.||ref='''2020''' July 27, {{lang|zh|《[https://cdnpuc.sinchew.com.my/ind/20200727.pdf 澳 10 人冠病死 單日新高]》}}, in ''{{w|Harian Indonesia}}'', page A5}}
# {{tcl|zh|Australia|id=Q3960}}
# {{label|zh|dated}} [[Oceania]]

====Usage notes====
While {{zh-l|澳洲}} is commonly used in Taiwan, Hong Kong and overseas Chinese communities to denote ''Australia'', it is not always understood in mainland China, or is misunderstood as ''Oceania''. To avoid confusion, the standard term {{zh-l|澳大利亞}} can be used.

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|Australia}} {{zh-l|澳大利亞}}; {{q|Taishanese|dated}} {{zh-l|*新金山}}
* {{sense|Oceania}} {{zh-l|大洋洲}}, {{zh-l|海洋洲}}

