==Maori==

===Etymology===
{{l|mi|te}} + {{l|mi|pāpaka}} + {{l|mi|a}} + {{l|mi|Māui}}. Literally means "the paddle crab of {{w|Māui (Māori mythology)|Māui}}", perhaps referring to the continent's shape resembling a crab. The name is also related to the two other names for North Island and South Island of New Zealand, which were related to a folktale about Maui.

